Acknowledgements

The six-phase reasoning schema (Samshaya, Pramana, Pancha Avayava,
Tarka, Hetvabhasa, Nirnaya) tested by this project is the modern
formulation described in:

    Sathish, Sharath. "Pramana: Fine-Tuning Large Language Models for
    Epistemic Reasoning through Navya-Nyaya."
    arXiv preprint arXiv:2604.04937 (2026).

Sharath Sathish designed and published this schema and the original
fine-tuning evaluation. The contribution of the present project is the
test harness and benchmark methodology only - the harness probes
whether the schema described in the paper can be elicited zero-shot
from a frontier LLM with a system prompt.

